---

This product bundles WinDivert 2.2.2 (WinDivert.dll, WinDivert64.sys, and its
import library and headers under vendor/), which is a separate work
dual-licensed under your choice of the GNU Lesser General Public License
(LGPL) Version 3 or the GNU General Public License (GPL) Version 2; this
project distributes it under the LGPL v3 choice. Throttle links to WinDivert
dynamically (the DLL is loaded at runtime) and ships it as separate,
replaceable files; the WinDivert library is not statically linked into the
Throttle binary. The Rust binding crates used to call WinDivert (windivert
0.6.0 and windivert-sys 0.10.0, LGPL-3.0-or-later) are compiled into the
binary as Rust code; their source ships with this project's source
distribution. See vendor/WinDivert-2.2.2-A/LICENSE for WinDivert's full terms.

[Wording note: the bundling note above corrects a factual error in the
upstream v0.1.2 LICENSE, which described WinDivert as "LGPL v3 (with a dual
GPL/proprietary option)". WinDivert's own LICENSE (first lines) and README
state the dual license is a choice between LGPL v3 and GPL v2 only; no
proprietary/commercial option is part of that dual license. The MIT License
text above is unchanged.]

